# The workspace has no runtime variables of its own.
#
# - ../smsg-api/.env.example and ../smsg-web/.env.example document each app's variables.
#   `make setup` copies them to .env.local (edit those by hand).
# - `make dev` writes .env.development.local in ../smsg-api and ../smsg-web with the local
#   Supabase URL, keys and DB URL (scripts/local-env.sh). Do not edit them.
# - Local secrets (super admin credentials, Supabase DB passwords) go in
#   secrets.env: see secrets.env.example.
